  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Enterprises For Economic Development.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the delivery of UK Government Priorities on economic development, empowering women and girls and working with the private sector. Through the provision of information it will help catalyse further investment. This programme will complement UK&#x2019;s international commitments on hunger, notably through support for the New Alliance on Food Security and Nutrition which aims to reach 50 million people in Africa with improved food security and nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
